all_delivery_late_orders])&#10;/*&#10;when &quot;% Rider Late &gt; 5min&quot; then [% Rider Late &gt; 5min]&#10;when &quot;% Rider Late &gt; 10min&quot; then [% Rider Late &gt; 10min]&#10;*/&#10;when &quot;Orders with Stacking&quot; then sum([daily_total_stacked_orders])&#10;//when &quot;% Orders with Stacking&quot; then [% Orders with Stacking]&#10;&#10;//when &quot;Dish Level Photo (DLP)&quot; then [Dish Level Photo (DLP)]&#10;//when &quot;Dish level Description (DLD)&quot; then [Dish level Description (DLD)]&#10;//when &quot;% Offline Duration&quot; then [% Offline Duration]&#10;&#10;when &quot;Deal Target Incentive Amount&quot; then sum([Calculation_222224497063833604])&#10;when &quot;Successful Orders with any Discount (Incl.voucher,gem)&quot; then sum([daily_successful_incentivized_order_count_with_gem])&#10;//when &quot;% Orders with any Discounts (Incl.voucher,gems)&quot; then  [% Incentivized Orders (Incl. Gems)]&#10;&#10;when &quot;Successful Free Delivery Orders (DF=0)&quot; then sum([daily_successful_fd_order_count])&#10;//when &quot;% Free Delivery orders (DF=0)&quot; then [% Free Delivery orders (DF=0)]&#10;&#10;when &quot;GMV of Vendors on Incentive&quot; then [Full GMV Coverage (copy)_2743114442592612352]&#10;//when &quot;GMV Coverage&quot; then [GMV Coverage]&#10;when &quot;GMV of Incentivised Orders&quot; then [Calculation_6203497390930489370]&#10;//when &quot;GMV Incentive Share&quot; then [GMV Incentive Share]&#10;when &quot;Savings (Incentive) Amount&quot; then [Calculation_6203497390926553109]&#10;//when &quot;Savings Amount over GMV %&quot; then [Savings Amount over GMV %]&#10;//when &quot;Best Seller - % of total GMV&quot; then [Best Seller - % of total GMV]&#10;&#10;when &quot;Incentivised Successful Orders&quot; then sum([inc_successful_order_count])&#10;//when &quot;Incentivised Orders Share, %&quot; then [Incentivised Orders Share, %]&#10;&#10;when &quot;New Customers (Platform Acquisitions)&quot; then sum([daily_order_new_customer_count]