    <worksheet name='Sales Performance KPIs - Benchmarks'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Benchmarks</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='7'>Select AM to view</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true' underline='true'>Important Notes</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>1. Full GMV Coverage: The campaigns are considered based on the initial setup dates. In case if a campagin settings (dates, status,etc) are changed, such changes are not taken into account while calculating this KPI</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>2. Buy x Get y: Not accurately captured due to engineering challenges. This is currently in progress</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>3. (Menu + Item + Inc.FD + BxGy) will not be equal to total VFD orders since multiple incentives can be applied for a single vendor</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>4. VAT has been removed from all NCR revenue metrics</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>5. Bad Vendor metrics are only applicable to only Food Vertical</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>6.VfContact Rate % : Vendor Fault Customer Contact Rate - Contacts due to vendor reasons (BeeHive Definition) </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>7. % of Vendor ProceParity : This KPI is accurate only for month level date granularity. Please make sure that 1st day of the month falls under the date range selected</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='am_chain_vendor_performance_dashboard' name='sqlproxy.0gxbmd80t3un2i1brp9ow036duee' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column caption='Team Lead Portfolio Type' datatype='string' name='[Acc. Manager Portfolio Type (copy)_3033174377011576832]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Current&quot;'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Current&quot;' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Acc. Manager Portfolio Type' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 12]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Current&quot;'>
